flowchart TD
    %% Data Preprocessing Pipeline - Detailed Feature Engineering
    
    Start([Raw Dataset]) --> Load["Load CSV<br/>data/roo.csv<br/>20,000 samples<br/>29 columns total"]
    
    Load --> Inspect["Data Inspection<br/>• Check missing values<br/>• Identify data types<br/>• Class distribution"]
    
    Inspect --> Separate["Separate Features<br/>X: 28 feature columns<br/>y: 'Suggested Job Role'"]
    
    Separate --> TypeSplit["Feature Type Split"]
    
    TypeSplit --> Numerical["Numerical Features (14)<br/>• Academic percentages (8)<br/>• Hours working per day<br/>• Logical quotient rating<br/>• Hackathons count<br/>• Coding skills rating<br/>• Public speaking points"]
    
    TypeSplit --> Categorical["Categorical Features (14)<br/>• Can work long time?<br/>• Self-learning capability<br/>• Extra courses<br/>• Certifications<br/>• Workshops<br/>• Reading/writing skills<br/>• Memory capability<br/>• Interested subjects<br/>• Career area interest<br/>• Job/Higher Studies<br/>• Company type preference<br/>• Management/Technical<br/>• Hard/smart worker<br/>• Worked in teams"]
    
    Numerical --> ScaleCheck{Missing<br/>Values?}
    ScaleCheck -->|Yes| Impute["Impute Missing<br/>Strategy: mean/median"]
    ScaleCheck -->|No| Scale
    Impute --> Scale["Standard Scaling<br/>Formula: z = (x - μ) / σ<br/>Result: mean=0, std=1"]
    
    Categorical --> EncodeCheck{Unknown<br/>Categories?}
    EncodeCheck -->|Handle| OneHot["One-Hot Encoding<br/>handle_unknown='ignore'<br/>sparse_output=False<br/>Output: 63 binary columns"]
    
    Scale --> Scaled["Scaled Numerical<br/>14 columns<br/>Normalized values"]
    OneHot --> Encoded["Encoded Categorical<br/>63 binary columns"]
    
    Scaled --> Concat["Concatenate Features<br/>np.hstack([X_num, X_cat])<br/>Final: 77 dimensions"]
    Encoded --> Concat
    
    Concat --> Target["Prepare Target<br/>34 unique career classes<br/>String labels"]
    
    Target --> CheckBalance["Check Class Balance"]
    
    CheckBalance --> Imbalance{Severe<br/>Imbalance?}
    
    Imbalance -->|Yes| Oversample["Random Oversampling<br/>Strategy: balance all classes<br/>SMOTE-like approach<br/>random_state=42"]
    Imbalance -->|No| Split
    
    Oversample --> Balanced["Balanced Dataset<br/>37,808 samples<br/>Equal class distribution"]
    
    Balanced --> Split["Train-Test Split<br/>test_size=0.2<br/>random_state=42<br/>stratify=y (maintain distribution)"]
    
    Split --> TrainSet["Training Set<br/>30,246 samples (80%)<br/>77 features"]
    Split --> TestSet["Test Set<br/>7,562 samples (20%)<br/>77 features"]
    
    TrainSet --> SaveArtifacts["Save Preprocessing Artifacts<br/>• StandardScaler object<br/>• OneHotEncoder object<br/>• Feature names<br/>• Label mappings"]
    TestSet --> SaveArtifacts
    
    SaveArtifacts --> Ready["Ready for Training"]
    
    Ready --> End([Preprocessed Data])
    
